Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Development Act, 2006 (
27 of 2006
);
(b)
"Chairperson" means the Chairperson of the Governing Council of the Fund as referred to in rule 6;
(c)
"Governing Council" means the Governing Council of the Fund referred to in sub-rule (1) of rule 5;
(d)
"Fund" means the Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Fund constituted in accordance with section 12 of the Act;
(e)
"Member-Secretary" means the Member Secretary of the Governing Council;
